  "visualBrief": "Capanda Dam with both concrete wings, four deep spillway chutes, yellow crest machinery, switchyard, downstream generator hall and walled tailrace.",
  "heightPolicy": "The shoreline median gives a 956 m reservoir model datum. The crest is modeled at 961 m and the tailrace at 875 m. Runtime positioning samples the nearby 958.33 m land shoulder. Standard inland water sampling from the retained raw field gives roughly 869–890 m for the reservoir, so geographic acceptance remains pending.",
